msgstr "无法读取根证书文件 \"%s\": %s"

#: fe-secure-openssl.c:1156
#, c-format
msgid ""
"could not get home directory to locate root certificate file\n"
"Either provide the file, use the system's trusted roots with "
"sslrootcert=system, or change sslmode to disable server certificate "
"verification."
msgstr ""
"无法获取主目录以定位根证书文件\n"
"提供该文件，使用 sslrootcert=system 采用系统信任的根证书，或更改 sslmode 以禁"
"用服务器证书验证。"

#: fe-secure-openssl.c:1159
#, c-format
msgid ""
"root certificate file \"%s\" does not exist\n"
"Either provide the file, use the system's trusted roots with "
"sslrootcert=system, or change sslmode to disable server certificate "
"verification."
msgstr ""
"根证书文件 \"%s\" 不存在\n"
"提供该文件，使用 sslrootcert=system 采用系统信任的根证书，或更改 sslmode 以禁"
"用服务器证书验证。"

